.TH "TODOPRO GITHUB LINK" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro github link Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-github\-link \- Link a TodoPro project to a GitHub Project...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro github link
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Link a TodoPro project to a GitHub Project v2 (Pro).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-todopro\-project\fP TEXT
TodoPro project id to link  [required]
.TP
\fB\-\-github\-project\fP TEXT
GitHub Project NODE id (the 'ID' from 'github projects', not the number)  [required]
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fP TEXT
Display name for the linked project
.TP
\fB\-\-url\fP TEXT
URL of the GitHub project
.TP
\fB\-\-direction\fP TEXT
Sync direction: pull, push, or both  [default: pull]
